  "description": "Drifting through orphanages, Mun-Young lives with a nameless fear and a longing he can't explain... until a black fox only he can see appears and quiets it. But once he's adopted—more like imprisoned—by the powerful Chunsung group, the fox disappears. Years later, it returns with one offer: freedom, for a price.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
